H12.FifthIsogeny.numerator_at_kernel.{u_1} {K : Type u_1} [Field K] (u : K) : H12.FifthIsogeny.num u u = u ^ 6
'H12.FifthIsogeny.numerator_at_kernel' depends on axioms: [propext, Quot.sound]
